d his  father  terrified the prince refused to fight  ozai viewed this as further disrespect  branding his son a coward before burning  his face  and banishing him from the fire nation  ozai told zuko that he could return to  the fire nation  on one condition that he find and  capture the long-lost avatar  iro grasping the sheer cruelty of his  brother's actions  offered to go along to help his nephew  on this seemingly impossible quest  iro spent the next several years urging  zuko to cool his heels  rightfully noting that zuko had the rest  of his life to search for the avatar  you know prince zuko destiny is  a funny thing you never know how things  are going to work out  iro and zuko did eventually find the  avatar in the south pole  where he had been trapped in ice for 100  years  as the avatar fled to the northern water  tribe in order to find a water bending  teacher  zuko and iro followed close behind  however they weren't the only ones  another fire nation soldier admiral zhao  was also looking to nab the avatar  himself  zhao and prince zuko had clashed several  times  with neither one gaining the upper hand  eventually  zhao attempted to assassinate zuko but  zuko was able to escape  and stowed away on zhao's ship iro aware  of zuko's arrival played the bereaved  uncle and traveled with zhao to the  northern water tribe  during the attack on the north however  zhao very nearly threw the entire world  into chaos  we killed the mortal embodiment of the  moon spirit as waterbenders  become more powerful at night when they  are aided by the moon  zhao decided that destroying the moon  spirit would end this advantage forever  believing that zhao had doomed the world  iro attacked him and his crew  still a warrior of legendary skill iro  was able to incapacitate  all of zhao's soldiers though the moon  spirit was restored by the actions of  princess ue  and the fire nation forces were turned  back by a massive show of angst power  word spread of ira's attack up